          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Kaangwí gooiimeek amór malaykamooduú múk kríshaanáy oo baraá Laodikeár i dirií',",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Axweesantí dír i dahh a dír kudá' ta bay Amin. Inós an lamabu'usmoodá' inkihhím nee oo looeemaá axweés. Inós an iimu/úngw muruudá' sleémeero Mungú aa tleéhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng kángw tlehhemi'iiwók u xuú', adór kuúng tur tsatsa'aareeká nee slám adór tar da/a/aandaaká. Geeraawo alók a tsiní kuúng barnaxes tun tsatsa'areema hhe'eés, laqaá barnaxes an da/a/aán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala daxta kuúng hám a tawó matláxw. Kuúng tu tsatsa'aareeká, nee slám a da/a/aandaaká. Gawaá adoorihe aníng kuúng baraá afkueene u waá/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng a kat, ‹Aníng a daqaarmo. Án tina kilooeé' daqaari'iitís, slám gár iwa /aaruur i káhh.› Ala laatí kuúng a xu'uká adór kuúng tar liitlakusmo, kuúng a heé gurtleemuú slaá', nee a narkutmo, nee heé taampa, nee slám a /aankwets. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe gár kuúng wa hariim a adoorí an tléhh, Sahaábuudá' taa hhoohhooeés ar asla dir'eé' tiwa tlaxw, as kuúng tawa daqaarmo tleehhit, nee tlabaadá' /awak kiwa tlaxw, nee kiwa dahas, as /aankwetsuuwók kudá' murér koóm mukuwa ara'ár. Nee slám maasáy na tlaxweek, ilaawók kiri slík, as kuúng tawa xumis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukdá' sleémeero aníng ni slaa' un iigahhamiít nee un muúx. Gawaá adoorihe kuúng ilakaaharu tleehheek, hhu'u'uúm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ga/aaweek, aníng a sihhimiít afkú dó' wa ale, a ateetiím. Hee barnaxes afor'eé' gaa axaás, nee afkú do' guri gweér, aníng a dáh amoorós, aníng niri al/ayiím nee inós, nee inós iri al/ayín dinkwa nee aníng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heedaádá' arba/ati gaa slay, aníng inós u iwiitiís dinkwa nee aníng gawaá kitangw'eé' kuduú aleesleemu, adoodá' aníng arba/ati ngira sláw, niri iwiít dinkwa nee Baabuúeé' gawaá kitaangós kuduú aleesleemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
